  "prompts": {
    "image": "Create the CRYSTAL award companion frame to image 1. Image 1 defines only exact 16:9 landscape studio composition, camera, seamless off-white studio backdrop and floor and blank right half. Replace the golden smile sculpture completely with the CRYSTAL sculpture from image 2, binding shape reference: clear colorless glass/crystal rounded triangular ribbon frame with large triangular hollow center, thick softly twisted beveled sides, smooth rounded tip and flat lower edge, exactly preserve the asymmetric facets visible in reference. No smile, no eyes, no gold cradle. Single complete crystal award centered at x=28%, bottom y=86%, top near y=14%, entirely within left 47%. Near-frontal long-lens product view matching image 1. Use subtle silver-grey edge reflections and restrained ice-blue rim light so transparent crystal remains readable on near-white. Physically realistic refraction, delicate contact shadow, faint cool caustics restricted beneath award. Clean blank off-white right half for future channel name and song title HTML. Opaque background. No pedestal, no black disk, no people, no environment, no text, no logo, no particles. Premium studio photograph. 1920x1080 landscape composition.",
    "endFrameDescription": "Identyczny kadr końcowy. Kamera i bryła bez zmian; planowana zmiana poświaty wyłącznie wewnątrz przyszłej animacji.",
